## About the standard

Part 3-2 describes the method for partitioning an IACS into zones and conduits, assessing risk and setting target security levels (SL-T). It is the starting point for selecting requirements from part 3-3.

Official source: [IEC 62443-3-2:2020](https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/30727).
